<title>MEXICO: Farben to issue debt, list on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Farben to issue debt, list on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican retailer Farmacias Benavides (Farben) said on Monday it planned to list on the New York Stock Exchange in the next two years.</p>
<p>&quot;We plan to list on the New York Stock Exchange. We think 18 months will be a reasonable period for everything to go through,&quot; Adrian Gutierrez, head of investor relations at the company, told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said the company would list about 28 million shares, or a fifth of the number of shares it has outstanding on the Mexican bourse.</p>
<p>((--Jacqueline Lerma, Monterrey bureau +528-345-7677))</p>
